Subject: [PATCH 34/38] Sync the liveness engine: ModelUpdater (online model
 update)

Engine jars from Mosip26 a080258 ("ModelUpdater: verified online model
download"), built at 2b42048 (fix round 4). The analyzer jar adds
integrity/ModelUpdater: it fetches latest.json and the bundle zip,
checks the size, SHA-256 and flat entries, and installs with
ModelStore.install(staged, bundled, keys). It accepts HTTPS only, or
plain HTTP to localhost with an explicit flag. The models and
CameraXFrameSource.java are unchanged (same SHA-256).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
